From 4d564cf0d960a6101e1adde943acfb5a1dd22300 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 12:00:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] Render the full wide film with kte render --final

Select the host's full-size wide composition and render the whole edit as
H.264 with AAC audio. Reject draft flags and section ranges in final mode.
Require a fully authored score and stop on compiler errors before starting
the browser. Preserve the draft and inspection render paths.

---
 cli/main.ts   | 12 ++++++++----
 cli/render.ts | 30 +++++++++++++++++++++++-------
 2 files changed, 31 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

diff --git a/cli/main.ts b/cli/main.ts
